    description: Concept DOI — always resolves to the latest version
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22234658"
    description: DOI for version 0.1.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/harukicoder/hsk30"
url: "https://github.com/harukicoder/hsk30"
abstract: >-
  "HSK 3.0" names two official documents: the GF0025-2021 national grading
  standard, in force since July 2021, and the examination syllabus published in
  November 2025 and in force since July 2026. They assign different levels to
  41.5% of the words and 40.7% of the characters they share, and grading real
  texts against one rather than the other changes the level of 48% of them.
  This package grades Chinese text against either document, records which, and
  ships an aligned graded-reader corpus and a difficulty-controlled generation
  benchmark.
keywords:
  - chinese
  - mandarin
  - hsk
